 ## Playbooks
 
 Match the task to a playbook and open its steps at `playbooks/<title>.md`, with the title in kebab case. Copy its steps into the todolist tool when the Interview ends, at its step 9. The order before step 1 is fixed: the Interview round, then the todo list, then the intent file, then the worktree. Large, cross-cutting, or unattended work, or a task no playbook fits, routes to the **figure-it-out** skill. A spec that splits into several tickets, some able to build in parallel, routes to **Spec build** instead, whose Interview row drafts the ticket graph when the request has none.
